# Everything under data/ is generated by tools/scan.ps1 on every run.
#
# It is also PERSONAL: it embeds your character names, realms, guilds, gold,
# Battle.net account folder names and absolute filesystem paths, plus your
# MySlot strings. Do not commit it.
data/

# Build artifacts of tools/build-launcher.ps1.
*.exe
tools/launcher.ico
WowAltBoard-v*.zip
AlterEgoWeb-v*.zip

# 临时脚本 / 临时文本（_gen_*.js、_msg.txt、_scan.json 那类）。
# 规矩是「跑完即删」，但我自己在 74a849a 里就手滑把 _msg.txt 提交进去了 ——
# 靠记性不如靠这条规则。
_*

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
